WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.150
- I didn't realize how
fricking tall you are.

00:00:02.150 --> 00:00:03.040
- I know.

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:05.290
It's, my wife is 5'3" so it's a strange--

00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:06.123
- [Kelly] Oh my god, I'm 5'3".

00:00:06.123 --> 00:00:06.956
That's why--
- [Brett] You are.

00:00:06.956 --> 00:00:08.360
- [Kelly] Yeah, I was like,
oh my gosh, you're tall.

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:09.193
- [Brett] Yeah.
- Yeah.

00:00:09.193 --> 00:00:11.540
- She, we had to go through
this whole conversation early

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:12.690
in the relationship where she was like,

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:14.530
stop bending down for the photo.

00:00:14.530 --> 00:00:16.390
Stand up, it's okay that you're tall.

00:00:16.390 --> 00:00:18.420
- Yeah, except I always
have this conversation

00:00:18.420 --> 00:00:19.800
with my other short
friends that date like,

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:21.690
or marry tall, tall men.

00:00:21.690 --> 00:00:23.760
Like it's gotta be awkward, you know

00:00:23.760 --> 00:00:24.593
'cause you're...

00:00:25.469 --> 00:00:26.302
Say kissing.

00:00:26.302 --> 00:00:27.880
When you're stand, it's just,
are you always hunched over?

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:30.067
- Yeah, like unless you
wanna do that whole like

00:00:30.067 --> 00:00:32.150
"Fifty Shades of Gray"
thing where you pick her up.

00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:34.661
- Well, some of us can't be picked up.

00:00:34.661 --> 00:00:36.082
(laughing)

00:00:36.082 --> 00:00:36.915
- [Brett] Stop.

00:00:36.915 --> 00:00:37.748
- Some of us.

00:00:38.651 --> 00:00:41.000
I'm like, here look,
I'll climb on this stair.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.540
- We have like baby number two on the way.

00:00:42.540 --> 00:00:44.340
So, can or can't--
- [Kelly] Congratulations.

00:00:44.340 --> 00:00:45.173
- Thank you.

00:00:45.173 --> 00:00:46.640
Can or can't is not
really a thing anymore.

00:00:46.640 --> 00:00:47.990
It's just like that's not the stage

00:00:47.990 --> 00:00:49.430
in the relationship right now.

00:00:49.430 --> 00:00:51.920
We're not flinging each other
around the house, you know.

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:54.510
- So wait, do you know
if it's a boy or girl?

00:00:54.510 --> 00:00:57.830
- Actually, we do and we
thought it would be a fun way

00:00:57.830 --> 00:01:00.470
to announce that.

00:01:00.470 --> 00:01:01.303
- [Kelly] On here?

00:01:01.303 --> 00:01:02.560
- Do the reveal right here today with you.

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:03.393
- Let's do it.

